# $crate_package_name

UniFFI-generated Python bindings for `auki-layout`.

The package exposes string adapters for the SDK's canonical on-disk path helpers:

```python
import $binding_module_name

assert $binding_module_name.sensor_entry_path("/app", "K1/head", "abcd") == (
    "/app/registries/sensors/K1__head/abcd.json"
)
```

The Rust crate keeps the source-compatible `&Path -> PathBuf` API; generated languages use UTF-8 path strings.
